# .gitignore — Projet LanzarMAXP124D
Ignorer les fichiers temporaires, caches, artefacts de build et données locales.

## Système
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

## Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.pdb
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

## Logs
*.log
logs/
debug.log

## Build / Output
build/
dist/
out/
tmp/
*.tmp

## DSP / Audio Tools
*.wav
*.aiff
*.flac
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.ogg

## Simulation (WinISD, DSP, etc.)
src/simulation/winisd/*.wdr
src/simulation/winisd/*.wdb
src/simulation/winisd/*.bak

## IDE / Éditeurs
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

## OSINT / Tools (si ajoutés)
Tools/
Tools/*

## Secrets (ne jamais commiter)
*.key
*.pem
*.crt
*.env
.env.*
